Appointment Reminder
=====================

Dear <%= @appointment.first_name %>,

This is a friendly reminder that you have an appointment at <%= @organization.name %> on <%= @appointment.formatted_date %>.

APPOINTMENT DETAILS
-------------------
Booking Reference: <%= @appointment.booking_reference %>
Service:           <%= @service.display_name %>
Date:              <%= @appointment.appointment_date.strftime("%A, %d %B %Y") %>
Time:              <%= @appointment.formatted_time %>
<% if @organization.full_address.present? %>Location:          <%= @organization.full_address %>
<% end %><% if @organization.contact_phone.present? %>Phone:             <%= @organization.contact_phone %>
<% end %>
<%= @organization.appointment_email_message_text %>

A calendar file is attached so you can add this appointment to your calendar.

